{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01B7CmwMZtNfWcGh6Nz1vMaU","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Integration Decision — QuantAgent-3o8\n2\t\n3\t- **Run ID:** 20260510T214304Z-QuantAgent-3o8-tech-lead\n4\t- **Ticket:** QuantAgent-3o8\n5\t- **Decision:** DO_NOT_MERGE\n6\t- **Status:** FAIL\n7\t- **Primary failure_class:** IMPLEMENTATION_INCOMPLETE\n8\t- **Primary failure_subclass:** replay_signal_provenance_collision\n9\t- **Secondary failure_class:** GIT_PREFLIGHT_DIRTY_OR_DIVERGED\n10\t- **Secondary failure_subclass:** stale_feature_branch\n11\t- **Executor lineage:** auto (implementer) -> tech-lead direct verification\n12\t- **Feature branch:** `feature/QuantAgent-3o8-implement-replay-execution-mode-reuse-an`\n13\t- **Feature commit under review:** `7886ad2b29f82603d5727ca624f9639f15c369f7`\n14\t- **Merge strategy:** none\n15\t- **Conflict status:** preflight overlap detected (`git merge-tree` reported `changed in both`)\n16\t- **Deploy status:** not_applicable\n17\t- **User manual:** skipped (no merge; no `docs/user-manual/` tree present)\n18\t- **Blocker issue:** `QuantAgent-375`\n19\t\n20\t## Why merge was rejected\n21\t1. The branch is 207 commits behind `origin/main`, so integration risk is already high.\n22\t2. More importantly, replay correctness is broken:\n23\t   - `Backtest.run_replay()` queries signals by asset/timeframe/date/environment only.\n24\t   - With overlapping source runs, `signal_map[(symbol, generated_at)]` is overwritten by whichever signal is loaded last.\n25\t   - Direct proof run showed `source_run_id=1` consuming signal `2` from another run, violating acceptance TC5 / TC11.\n26\t\n27\t## Evidence reviewed\n28\t- Issue docs on candidate branch:\n29\t  - `docs/01_requirements/QuantAgent-3o8-RQ-replay-execution.md`\n30\t  - `docs/03_design/QuantAgent-3o8-DS-replay-execution.md`\n31\t  - `docs/05_acceptance_tests/QuantAgent-3o8-AC-replay-execution.md`\n32\t- Implementer comment + commit `7886ad2b`\n33\t- `python3 -m compileall -q quantagent apps alembic` -> PASS\n34\t- Direct replay provenance proof -> FAIL (cross-run signal contamination)\n35\t- `git merge-tree` preflight -> overlap detected\n36\t\n37\t## Follow-up required before re-integration\n38\t- Land blocker `QuantAgent-375` from a fresh branch based on current `origin/main`\n39\t- Add deterministic source-run signal scoping\n40\t- Add regression tests for overlapping runs\n41\t- Re-run tester + integration after fix\n42\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f08f8d0e-dfe1-47d6-abdf-e601734c006c","uuid":"f5fb5cbd-b914-4f6f-acfb-bb5225a08cb0","timestamp":"2026-05-11T07:39:15.547Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/azureuser/repos/projects/QuantAgent/docs/envelopes/QuantAgent-3o8/20260510T214304Z-QuantAgent-3o8-tech-lead/integration-decision-20260510T214304Z.md","content":"# Integration Decision — QuantAgent-3o8\n\n- **Run ID:** 20260510T214304Z-QuantAgent-3o8-tech-lead\n- **Ticket:** QuantAgent-3o8\n- **Decision:** DO_NOT_MERGE\n- **Status:** FAIL\n- **Primary failure_class:** IMPLEMENTATION_INCOMPLETE\n- **Primary failure_subclass:** replay_signal_provenance_collision\n- **Secondary failure_class:** GIT_PREFLIGHT_DIRTY_OR_DIVERGED\n- **Secondary failure_subclass:** stale_feature_branch\n- **Executor lineage:** auto (implementer) -> tech-lead direct verification\n- **Feature branch:** `feature/QuantAgent-3o8-implement-replay-execution-mode-reuse-an`\n- **Feature commit under review:** `7886ad2b29f82603d5727ca624f9639f15c369f7`\n- **Merge strategy:** none\n- **Conflict status:** preflight overlap detected (`git merge-tree` reported `changed in both`)\n- **Deploy status:** not_applicable\n- **User manual:** skipped (no merge; no `docs/user-manual/` tree present)\n- **Blocker issue:** `QuantAgent-375`\n\n## Why merge was rejected\n1. The branch is 207 commits behind `origin/main`, so integration risk is already high.\n2. More importantly, replay correctness is broken:\n   - `Backtest.run_replay()` queries signals by asset/timeframe/date/environment only.\n   - With overlapping source runs, `signal_map[(symbol, generated_at)]` is overwritten by whichever signal is loaded last.\n   - Direct proof run showed `source_run_id=1` consuming signal `2` from another run, violating acceptance TC5 / TC11.\n\n## Evidence reviewed\n- Issue docs on candidate branch:\n  - `docs/01_requirements/QuantAgent-3o8-RQ-replay-execution.md`\n  - `docs/03_design/QuantAgent-3o8-DS-replay-execution.md`\n  - `docs/05_acceptance_tests/QuantAgent-3o8-AC-replay-execution.md`\n- Implementer comment + commit `7886ad2b`\n- `python3 -m compileall -q quantagent apps alembic` -> PASS\n- Direct replay provenance proof -> FAIL (cross-run signal contamination)\n- `git merge-tree` preflight -> overlap detected\n\n## Follow-up required before re-integration\n- Land blocker `QuantAgent-375` from a fresh branch based on current `origin/main`\n- Add deterministic source-run signal scoping\n- Add regression tests for overlapping runs\n- Re-run tester + integration after fix\n","numLines":42,"startLine":1,"totalLines":42}}}
