{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bti2r3CaVLz6Ap1Ea5iuyj","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Run Report — QuantAgent-3o8 — implementer\n2\t\n3\t**Run-ID**: 20260510T073737Z-QuantAgent-3o8-implementer  \n4\t**Phase**: implementer  \n5\t**Branch**: feature/QuantAgent-3o8-implement-replay-execution-mode-reuse-an  \n6\t**Commit**: 7886ad2b\n7\t\n8\t---\n9\t\n10\t## Summary\n11\t\n12\tImplemented Replay execution mode for QuantAgent-3o8. Four files changed:\n13\t\n14\t| File | Change |\n15\t|------|--------|\n16\t| `quantagent/models.py` | Added `replay_source_run_id` FK + relationship to `BacktestRun` |\n17\t| `alembic/versions/c9a1b2d3e4f5_...py` | New migration: adds the column + FK + index |\n18\t| `quantagent/backtesting/backtest.py` | `run_replay()`, `_replay_and_trade()`, updated `_create_backtest_run()` and `_calculate_metrics()`, fixed duplicate imports |\n19\t| `apps/streamlit/views/replay.py` | Full rewrite: source-run selector, profile multiselect, sequential execution, comparison table |\n20\t\n21\t---\n22\t\n23\t## Acceptance Criteria Coverage\n24\t\n25\t| Criteria | Status |\n26\t|----------|--------|\n27\t| Select a completed backtest_run | ✅ UI lists runs from DB |\n28\t| Select portfolio/risk profiles | ✅ Multiselect from StrategyConfig + session |\n29\t| Replay uses stored signals (no LLM) | ✅ `_replay_and_trade()` loads signal from DB map |\n30\t| Different profiles → distinct P&L | ✅ Each replay is a fresh Backtest with merged config |\n31\t| Comparison view with side-by-side metrics | ✅ `_render_comparison()` renders dataframe table |\n32\t\n33\t---\n34\t\n35\t## Key Design Choices\n36\t\n37\t- **Signal lookup**: `(symbol, generated_at)` exact-match map — same date iteration as source run guarantees hits.\n38\t- **Metric scoping**: `_replay_trade_order_ids` set tracks order IDs created during replay; `_calculate_metrics()` filters by them so source-run trades are excluded.\n39\t- **Replay BacktestRun**: Created with `replay_source_run_id=source_run_id` for provenance.\n40\t- **No LLM calls**: `_replay_and_trade()` skips `strategy.generate_signal()`; position exit logic (`strategy.should_exit()`) still runs since it's rule-based (stop-loss/take-profit).\n41\t\n42\t---\n43\t\n44\t## Quality Gates\n45\t\n46\t| Gate | Result |\n47\t|------|--------|\n48\t| `git status --short` | 4 files changed, clean after commit |\n49\t| `ruff check --fix` | 9 auto-fixed, 0 remaining |\n50\t| `python -m compileall -q` | PASS (all quantagent/, alembic/, apps/) |\n51\t| `pytest test_backtest.py test_backtest_integration.py` | SKIP — requires DATABASE_URL + OPENAI_API_KEY (not available in executor environment) |\n52\t\n53\t---\n54\t\n55\t## Next Steps\n56\t\n57\t1. **Alembic migration**: run `alembic upgrade head` against real DB before merging\n58\t2. **Manual QA**: run a source backtest, then use Replay tab with different profiles\n59\t3. **Tests**: add unit tests for `run_replay()` (tester phase or manual)\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f08f8d0e-dfe1-47d6-abdf-e601734c006c","uuid":"150e9a14-13be-4567-ba24-fc3530ecc9e6","timestamp":"2026-05-11T07:39:15.663Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/azureuser/repos/projects/QuantAgent/docs/envelopes/QuantAgent-3o8/20260510T073737Z-QuantAgent-3o8-implementer/run-report.md","content":"# Run Report — QuantAgent-3o8 — implementer\n\n**Run-ID**: 20260510T073737Z-QuantAgent-3o8-implementer  \n**Phase**: implementer  \n**Branch**: feature/QuantAgent-3o8-implement-replay-execution-mode-reuse-an  \n**Commit**: 7886ad2b\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented Replay execution mode for QuantAgent-3o8. Four files changed:\n\n| File | Change |\n|------|--------|\n| `quantagent/models.py` | Added `replay_source_run_id` FK + relationship to `BacktestRun` |\n| `alembic/versions/c9a1b2d3e4f5_...py` | New migration: adds the column + FK + index |\n| `quantagent/backtesting/backtest.py` | `run_replay()`, `_replay_and_trade()`, updated `_create_backtest_run()` and `_calculate_metrics()`, fixed duplicate imports |\n| `apps/streamlit/views/replay.py` | Full rewrite: source-run selector, profile multiselect, sequential execution, comparison table |\n\n---\n\n## Acceptance Criteria Coverage\n\n| Criteria | Status |\n|----------|--------|\n| Select a completed backtest_run | ✅ UI lists runs from DB |\n| Select portfolio/risk profiles | ✅ Multiselect from StrategyConfig + session |\n| Replay uses stored signals (no LLM) | ✅ `_replay_and_trade()` loads signal from DB map |\n| Different profiles → distinct P&L | ✅ Each replay is a fresh Backtest with merged config |\n| Comparison view with side-by-side metrics | ✅ `_render_comparison()` renders dataframe table |\n\n---\n\n## Key Design Choices\n\n- **Signal lookup**: `(symbol, generated_at)` exact-match map — same date iteration as source run guarantees hits.\n- **Metric scoping**: `_replay_trade_order_ids` set tracks order IDs created during replay; `_calculate_metrics()` filters by them so source-run trades are excluded.\n- **Replay BacktestRun**: Created with `replay_source_run_id=source_run_id` for provenance.\n- **No LLM calls**: `_replay_and_trade()` skips `strategy.generate_signal()`; position exit logic (`strategy.should_exit()`) still runs since it's rule-based (stop-loss/take-profit).\n\n---\n\n## Quality Gates\n\n| Gate | Result |\n|------|--------|\n| `git status --short` | 4 files changed, clean after commit |\n| `ruff check --fix` | 9 auto-fixed, 0 remaining |\n| `python -m compileall -q` | PASS (all quantagent/, alembic/, apps/) |\n| `pytest test_backtest.py test_backtest_integration.py` | SKIP — requires DATABASE_URL + OPENAI_API_KEY (not available in executor environment) |\n\n---\n\n## Next Steps\n\n1. **Alembic migration**: run `alembic upgrade head` against real DB before merging\n2. **Manual QA**: run a source backtest, then use Replay tab with different profiles\n3. **Tests**: add unit tests for `run_replay()` (tester phase or manual)\n","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":60}}}
