{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011nhQo8L25QziSeWU9XBSnq","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Planning\n2\t\n3\tThis folder contains project roadmaps, task management, and planning artifacts for the QuantAgent system.\n4\t\n5\t## Reading Order\n6\t\n7\tAgents working in this repository should read planning documents in this order:\n8\t\n9\t1. **Current Phase Roadmaps** (start here)\n10\t   - [phase1_roadmap.md](./phase1_roadmap.md) - Phase 1 development plan and milestones\n11\t   - [phase2_roadmap.md](./phase2_roadmap.md) - Phase 2 development plan and milestones\n12\t\n13\t## Current Truth\n14\t\n15\tThe roadmap files represent the current development phases and priorities. When planning work:\n16\t\n17\t- Consult the relevant phase roadmap for context\n18\t- Align new tasks with phase objectives\n19\t- Use Beads (`bd ready`) to view current backlog and ready tasks\n20\t\n21\t## Active Per-Change Planning\n22\t\n23\t- [QuantAgent-40j-PL-parallel-test-fix.md](./QuantAgent-40j-PL-parallel-test-fix.md) - Fix missing benchmark fixture for parallel execution test (P1, blocks 82t)\n24\t- [QuantAgent-c69-PL-llm-agent-strategy-m1.md](./QuantAgent-c69-PL-llm-agent-strategy-m1.md) - M1 Strategy 2: LLMAgentStrategy reference pipeline (m1, strategy)\n25\t- [QuantAgent-r78-PL-trade-pnl-calculation.md](./QuantAgent-r78-PL-trade-pnl-calculation.md) - Trade P&L calculation bug fix (P1)\n26\t- [QuantAgent-les-PL-commissions-pnl.md](./QuantAgent-les-PL-commissions-pnl.md) - Support commissions in P&L calculation (P3, feature)\n27\t- [QuantAgent-nu7-PL-active-position-monitoring.md](./QuantAgent-nu7-PL-active-position-monitoring.md) - Active Position Monitoring System (Epic: QuantAgent-nu7)\n28\t- [QuantAgent-8vb-backtest-analysis.md](./QuantAgent-8vb-backtest-analysis.md) - Backtest log analysis (P0 bugs identified)\n29\t- [QuantAgent-7bn-PL-azure-openai-support.md](./QuantAgent-7bn-PL-azure-openai-support.md) - Azure OpenAI LLM provider support\n30\t- [QuantAgent-ou3-spx-data-fetch.md](./QuantAgent-ou3-spx-data-fetch.md) - SPX/yfinance intraday data fix (P2)\n31\t- [QuantAgent-lmn-deprecated-parameter.md](./QuantAgent-lmn-deprecated-parameter.md) - Deprecated wait_sec cleanup (P3)\n32\t- [QuantAgent-6t4-PL-structured-output-vision-agents.md](./QuantAgent-6t4-PL-structured-output-vision-agents.md) - Structured output refactor for pattern/trend vision agents\n33\t- [QuantAgent-1p7-PL-stategraph-image-paths.md](./QuantAgent-1p7-PL-stategraph-image-paths.md) - Minimal implementation plan for disk-backed StateGraph visualization artifacts\n34\t\n35\t## Per-Change Planning Documents\n36\t\n37\tPer-change planning documents should follow this naming convention:\n38\t\n39\t```\n40\tQuantAgent-<issue-id>-PL-<short-slug>.md\n41\t```\n42\t\n43\tExample: `QuantAgent-a3f2dd-PL-backtest-optimization.md`\n44\t\n45\tThese files describe planning deltas, task breakdowns, and execution strategies for specific changes linked to Beads issues (when applicable for system implementations).\n46\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f08f8d0e-dfe1-47d6-abdf-e601734c006c","uuid":"a5a6ad26-e2cb-4a38-9a36-2c45da325a85","timestamp":"2026-05-11T07:39:57.018Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/azureuser/repos/projects/QuantAgent/docs/02_planning/README.md","content":"# Planning\n\nThis folder contains project roadmaps, task management, and planning artifacts for the QuantAgent system.\n\n## Reading Order\n\nAgents working in this repository should read planning documents in this order:\n\n1. **Current Phase Roadmaps** (start here)\n   - [phase1_roadmap.md](./phase1_roadmap.md) - Phase 1 development plan and milestones\n   - [phase2_roadmap.md](./phase2_roadmap.md) - Phase 2 development plan and milestones\n\n## Current Truth\n\nThe roadmap files represent the current development phases and priorities. When planning work:\n\n- Consult the relevant phase roadmap for context\n- Align new tasks with pha